# Prettier scope. Same policy as eslint.config.mjs — prettier only checks code
# this repo owns and writes.
#
# Third-party agent skills ship their own code style (T0.2) and are excluded
# from lint for that reason; 242 of the 458 files prettier previously flagged
# lived here alone. Generated project output, agent/tooling state directories,
# and build output are all machine- or vendor-written.
.agents/
.claude/
.opencode/
.omp/
.zcode/
.omo/
projects/
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Prose and data are hand-formatted on purpose. Prettier's markdown handling
# realigns every table to uniform column widths, which rewrites long sections
# of otherwise-unchanged documents for zero semantic gain; the JSON/YAML files
# here are hand-tuned fixtures. Prettier formats code, not prose.
**/*.md
**/*.geojson